WEBVTT

00:00:10.835 --> 00:00:15.865
On that cold night, I came to realize

00:00:15.865 --> 00:00:20.845
that there's a place deeper down
that hurts even more than injuries

00:00:20.845 --> 00:00:26.075
In this world painted with lies

00:00:26.075 --> 00:00:30.685
where it's not clear what's true anymore

00:00:30.685 --> 00:00:33.585
I wanted to keep you safe

00:00:33.585 --> 00:00:40.725
The moment that
distortion and love overlapped,

00:00:40.725 --> 00:00:48.805
the wind embraced the
sadness that had closed in

00:00:48.805 --> 00:01:00.115
I'll never forget your sole voice
that continues to echo through the sky

00:01:00.115 --> 00:01:08.955
The prayer is going to melt
away and disappear, just like snow

00:01:08.955 --> 00:01:13.595
Today, I'll increase my speed again

00:01:13.595 --> 00:01:17.695
as I search for the reason for living

00:01:17.695 --> 00:01:29.095
even if I can't be a hero just yet

00:01:33.485 --> 00:01:35.615
Zwolf's early warning system

00:01:35.615 --> 00:01:39.715
has picked up a B2 bomber
coming in from the Adriatic Sea.

00:01:39.715 --> 00:01:43.085
It's not on German air force radar yet.

00:01:43.085 --> 00:01:46.625
- Any notifications from the U.N. Forces?
- Nothing at all.

00:01:46.625 --> 00:01:50.935
I've confirmed that two B2s
were stationed on Diego Garcia Island

00:01:50.935 --> 00:01:53.305
a little before noon today.

00:01:53.305 --> 00:01:55.905
I believe the approaching
aircraft is one of those two.

00:01:55.905 --> 00:01:57.935
I doubt they'd send only one.

00:01:57.935 --> 00:01:59.275
Shido...

00:01:59.275 --> 00:02:02.375
It's safe to assume the
other will head here too.

00:02:02.375 --> 00:02:08.085
They're not fooling around.
One B2 can carry 16 AGM129s.

00:02:08.085 --> 00:02:10.815
Even without air superiority,
they can burn Germany to the ground

00:02:10.815 --> 00:02:12.715
from 3000 kilometers away.

00:02:12.715 --> 00:02:15.455
Advanced cruise missiles...

00:02:15.455 --> 00:02:17.825
Don't tell me they'll use W80 warheads?!

00:02:17.825 --> 00:02:20.595
Given that they're sneaking up
without any notice whatsoever,

00:02:20.595 --> 00:02:25.585
they probably intend to put an
end to everything for sure in one shot.

00:02:27.635 --> 00:02:31.075
Mei-Fong. Try contacting
the chancellor's residence too.

00:02:32.775 --> 00:02:37.445
Worst-case scenario, we'll
have to deal with them ourselves.

00:02:37.445 --> 00:02:40.315
Mei-Fong and I will go.

00:02:40.315 --> 00:02:42.945
You continue to prepare the Isis.

00:02:42.945 --> 00:02:45.315
You can't be serious!
Without the Bow-rider, you'll!

00:02:45.315 --> 00:02:48.425
We can at least buy some time.

00:02:48.425 --> 00:02:53.665
Our trump card for defeating
Xargin is what's most important now.

00:02:53.665 --> 00:02:57.465
All right. I'll hurry with my work
here and then meet up with you.

00:02:57.465 --> 00:02:58.435
I'm counting on you.

00:02:58.435 --> 00:03:00.055
Leave it to us.

00:03:01.705 --> 00:03:04.275
The American army is really serious.

00:03:04.275 --> 00:03:05.675
I'm not surprised;

00:03:05.675 --> 00:03:09.365
they can't think of any other
way to stop the spread of Amalgams.

00:03:09.905 --> 00:03:14.675
How many times is that country
going to repeat the same mistake?

00:03:20.855 --> 00:03:24.525
I'm sorry for acting selfishly.

00:03:24.525 --> 00:03:28.755
But this is something I thought
over in my own way and decided to do.

00:03:31.795 --> 00:03:36.325
I promised Hermann that I would keep you safe...

00:03:38.005 --> 00:03:43.275
...but I can't fight while
protecting you like Hermann did.

00:03:43.275 --> 00:03:44.945
Which is why...

00:03:44.945 --> 00:03:46.545
Malek?!

00:03:46.545 --> 00:03:51.755
I'm going to make a move
before Xargin strikes again.

00:03:51.755 --> 00:03:53.185
Malek!

00:03:53.185 --> 00:03:56.185
I think the most important
thing now is buying time

00:03:56.185 --> 00:03:59.995
until Sasha-san can complete the Isis.

00:03:59.995 --> 00:04:05.465
Until then, Amanda, keep
Joseph and the Isis data safe...

00:04:05.465 --> 00:04:14.105
I guess I am a weakling after all...

00:04:14.105 --> 00:04:17.015
Malek...

00:04:17.015 --> 00:04:19.175
I'm going to try hard too.

00:04:19.175 --> 00:04:24.375
Please, let our valiant
efforts now mean something...

00:04:30.795 --> 00:04:32.355
Mei-Fong. Current altitude?

00:04:32.355 --> 00:04:35.665
Now at 300 kilometers, in low earth orbit.

00:04:35.665 --> 00:04:38.295
Currently conducting primary operation.

00:04:40.405 --> 00:04:45.495
Have reached drop point! Commencing attack!

00:04:52.115 --> 00:04:54.545
Hits confirmed. The first bomber is down.

00:04:54.545 --> 00:04:56.645
But where's the other one?!

00:04:56.645 --> 00:04:59.555
Stay alert. We should be detecting it somewhere.

00:04:59.555 --> 00:05:02.085
The only thing on radar is civilian aircraft!

00:05:02.085 --> 00:05:04.685
Civilian aircraft?!

00:05:11.395 --> 00:05:13.055
Mei-Fong!

00:05:16.605 --> 00:05:19.905
What?! It was in a passenger plane's shadow?!

00:05:21.375 --> 00:05:23.975
The intercept point is just as I anticipated!

00:05:23.975 --> 00:05:25.975
Radar is useless in this terrain!

00:05:25.975 --> 00:05:28.715
Give me visual confirmation
of the missiles' locations!

00:05:28.715 --> 00:05:30.945
Don't miss a single one!

00:05:32.655 --> 00:05:34.425
Shido! Fighter jets!

00:05:34.425 --> 00:05:36.755
Don't worry about 'em!
You'll give away your location!

00:05:36.755 --> 00:05:39.195
Don't take your eyes off the missiles!

00:05:40.795 --> 00:05:44.055
I won't let you bastards have your way!

00:06:21.305 --> 00:06:23.675
I can see...

00:06:23.675 --> 00:06:28.445
I can see it... I can see the world!

00:06:28.445 --> 00:06:31.115
This is the vantage point of God...

00:06:31.115 --> 00:06:38.755
I am infinite... I am everlasting!

00:06:38.755 --> 00:06:46.125
Yes! I will be the new world's God!

00:06:46.125 --> 00:06:48.095
Hey, are you serious?

00:06:48.095 --> 00:06:51.635
Didn't you used to work for God?

00:06:51.635 --> 00:06:54.905
I have surpassed humanity!

00:06:54.905 --> 00:06:59.465
Oh, really? Have fun for
the rest of eternity, then.

00:07:19.755 --> 00:07:23.595
It's complete. All that's left
is to insert it into a cartridge.

00:07:23.595 --> 00:07:26.535
Looks like you just barely made it in time.

00:07:26.535 --> 00:07:27.505
Elea?

00:07:27.505 --> 00:07:31.205
The main system that merged
with the commander just restarted.

00:07:31.205 --> 00:07:36.205
In a few more hours, he'll
probably have full control of this facility.

00:07:36.205 --> 00:07:39.115
- Such an unpleasant idea.
- You're safe?!

00:07:39.115 --> 00:07:43.715
I switched to the GARM
system and cut him off its network.

00:07:43.715 --> 00:07:47.755
Being with something that hideous disgusts me!

00:07:47.755 --> 00:07:52.055
So this is goodbye. You should
really think about escaping soon, too.

00:07:52.055 --> 00:07:54.865
Hold on a second, Elea.

00:07:54.865 --> 00:07:57.695
I have something for you to deliver to Joseph.

00:08:00.905 --> 00:08:02.865
Sounds interesting.

00:08:02.865 --> 00:08:06.305
Sure, I'll go along with it.

00:08:42.145 --> 00:08:45.445
It looks like you woke sooner than I expected.

00:08:45.445 --> 00:08:47.485
You knew I was coming?

00:08:47.485 --> 00:08:52.555
You did disappoint me,
but I still had high hopes for you.

00:08:52.555 --> 00:08:58.985
I'm happy to see that Joseph's
judgment wasn't off the mark at all.

00:09:03.495 --> 00:09:09.965
With those powers of the grace
of God, what is it you desire, boy?

00:09:09.965 --> 00:09:13.605
To defeat you and protect those dear to me!

00:09:13.605 --> 00:09:17.345
Do you think that will atone for your mistakes?

00:09:17.345 --> 00:09:18.745
I don't know.

00:09:18.745 --> 00:09:25.255
But I'll never find a way to atone
for them if you put an end to the world!

00:09:25.255 --> 00:09:26.885
All right, then.

00:09:26.885 --> 00:09:33.725
Let us see if your petty
wish surpasses my prayer or not!

00:09:54.645 --> 00:09:57.515
Shido! This is crazy!
The Sword-rider can't endure it!

00:09:57.515 --> 00:10:01.925
Mei-Fong! Just stay there and maintain altitude!

00:10:01.925 --> 00:10:04.395
Don't even think about
coming down to lend support!

00:10:04.395 --> 00:10:05.855
But!

00:10:05.855 --> 00:10:08.125
You're my eyes right now!

00:10:08.125 --> 00:10:11.995
Don't let any cruise missiles go
unnoticed! That's all that matters!

00:10:16.465 --> 00:10:21.335
I won't let Germany be a repeat of Japan!

00:10:28.885 --> 00:10:31.655
Foolish...

00:10:31.655 --> 00:10:34.785
Utterly foolish...

00:10:34.785 --> 00:10:39.815
The only thing you really wish
to protect is a handful of people.

00:10:44.965 --> 00:10:46.965
Surely you now have the ability to differentiate

00:10:46.965 --> 00:10:51.505
between those who should be
destroyed and those who should be saved.

00:10:51.505 --> 00:10:54.305
Why do you refuse to use it properly?

00:10:54.305 --> 00:10:58.075
Because... I'm weak!

00:10:58.075 --> 00:11:02.145
Because I can't endure the
weight of murdering people!

00:11:02.145 --> 00:11:03.805
But, Xargin...

00:11:05.385 --> 00:11:09.225
You're... even weaker!

00:11:09.225 --> 00:11:13.525
You threw everything away out of despair!

00:11:13.525 --> 00:11:16.355
You're more of a weakling than I am!

00:11:26.905 --> 00:11:32.145
Many people taught me what true strength is!

00:11:32.145 --> 00:11:35.115
That's why I...

00:11:35.115 --> 00:11:38.485
...will never lose to the likes of you!

00:11:45.355 --> 00:11:47.755
Such sorrowful wailing.

00:11:51.195 --> 00:11:58.365
I only know of one way to
save you from that agony.

00:12:24.195 --> 00:12:25.495
Shido!

00:12:25.495 --> 00:12:28.035
How many...

00:12:28.035 --> 00:12:31.105
How many missiles left?

00:12:31.105 --> 00:12:34.575
Only two. But they're too far apart!

00:12:34.575 --> 00:12:36.405
The Sword-rider alone won't be enough!

00:12:36.405 --> 00:12:38.845
- I'll handle the rest from here!
- Don't move!

00:12:42.045 --> 00:12:44.985
Have faith in me...

00:12:56.965 --> 00:13:00.495
No more Nagasakis...

00:13:00.495 --> 00:13:04.095
No more Hiroshimas!

00:13:16.885 --> 00:13:18.545
Sakura...

00:13:21.585 --> 00:13:23.715
I leave the rest to you...

00:13:29.565 --> 00:13:31.225
Shido!

00:14:05.795 --> 00:14:10.775
Shido... Thank you...

00:14:10.775 --> 00:14:13.065
The Isis is complete.

00:14:28.085 --> 00:14:30.955
Sasha! They're attacking
from satellite orbit now!

00:14:30.955 --> 00:14:34.065
It looks like they really want us dead.

00:14:34.065 --> 00:14:35.225
This is bad.

00:14:35.225 --> 00:14:38.995
I'm not sure I can intercept all of
the missiles from my present location.

00:14:38.995 --> 00:14:41.705
That's okay. We're not dealing
with stealth planes this time.

00:14:41.705 --> 00:14:43.805
I can lend backup from here with the Bow-rider.

00:14:43.805 --> 00:14:47.205
Are you sure? I thought the
charged particle cannon's cooling system

00:14:47.205 --> 00:14:49.105
couldn't keep up with repeated use?

00:14:49.105 --> 00:14:51.335
You know we have no choice.

00:14:57.685 --> 00:14:59.815
This is!

00:14:59.815 --> 00:15:04.125
Long time, no see. Is this
where Joseph is being sheltered?

00:15:04.125 --> 00:15:06.725
- Who are you?
- Elea.

00:15:06.725 --> 00:15:08.385
Joseph!

00:15:11.835 --> 00:15:12.895
What's the situation?

00:15:12.895 --> 00:15:16.665
Zwolf's facility won't be of any use anymore.

00:15:16.665 --> 00:15:22.105
It looks like it's all going
to come down to you, Joseph.

00:15:22.105 --> 00:15:25.915
Here's a present from
your brother-doting sister.

00:15:25.915 --> 00:15:29.615
Anti-nanomachines called Isis, apparently.

00:15:29.615 --> 00:15:30.855
They completed it?!

00:15:30.855 --> 00:15:33.455
Anti-nanomachines...

00:15:33.455 --> 00:15:37.155
I see. So my sister sent it...

00:15:37.155 --> 00:15:39.325
Where's Xargin?

00:15:39.325 --> 00:15:43.765
Malek already went to see him.
He said he was going to buy us time...

00:15:45.795 --> 00:15:48.335
This time, I will save Malek.

00:15:48.335 --> 00:15:49.995
What about you?

00:15:51.835 --> 00:15:58.315
You're not going to promise
me that you'll come back alive?

00:15:58.315 --> 00:15:59.975
This is goodbye.

00:16:03.685 --> 00:16:07.385
You've been hurt and suffered more than anyone,

00:16:07.385 --> 00:16:10.085
but why must you stay unappreciated?

00:16:10.085 --> 00:16:14.125
Why must you be all alone to the very end?

00:16:14.125 --> 00:16:15.785
I have faith.

00:16:17.195 --> 00:16:22.905
If, after everything is said and done,
there's someone who still survives...

00:16:22.905 --> 00:16:26.805
...then that is our salvation as Blassreiters.

00:16:28.845 --> 00:16:31.175
I leave the rest to you.

00:16:33.375 --> 00:16:36.005
Live enough for you too, you mean?

00:16:49.695 --> 00:16:54.965
People are such curious creatures.
They never cease to interest me!

00:16:54.965 --> 00:16:57.105
The same goes for you, Elea.

00:16:57.105 --> 00:17:01.435
Don't compare me with them!
They're very unbeautiful!

00:17:37.775 --> 00:17:42.815
Now look into the sky.

00:17:42.815 --> 00:17:45.085
That is humanity's decision.

00:17:45.085 --> 00:17:50.185
They won't hesitate to wipe out
fellow human beings for self-protection.

00:17:50.185 --> 00:17:55.095
Despite this, you insist
that they're worth protecting?

00:18:11.015 --> 00:18:13.775
It's taking too long to cool off after all!

00:18:23.085 --> 00:18:25.555
A high-speed object in the stratosphere?!

00:18:26.095 --> 00:18:27.755
Mach 23?!

00:18:30.595 --> 00:18:35.895
A 7th-generation ICBM...
They've already been deployed?

00:18:55.955 --> 00:18:58.295
Look, Joseph...

00:18:58.295 --> 00:19:02.795
Sasha is prepared to die yet again.

00:19:02.795 --> 00:19:08.405
Why is it those who deserve to be
saved always choose a foolish end?

00:19:08.405 --> 00:19:14.435
Why can't they ever realize the
futility of opposing inescapable ruin?

00:19:16.545 --> 00:19:18.335
It isn't foolish.

00:19:21.985 --> 00:19:24.005
Nor is it futile.

00:19:28.225 --> 00:19:33.415
My sister gave me our
last chance of stopping you.

00:19:38.935 --> 00:19:41.305
It takes an hour for the Isis to take effect.

00:19:41.305 --> 00:19:44.375
Will they be able to hold out that long?

00:19:44.375 --> 00:19:49.475
I see. So you've finally
reached the top, Joseph.

00:19:49.475 --> 00:19:53.015
Long ago, we tried to heal the world

00:19:53.015 --> 00:19:55.615
and shared the same prayer in our hearts.

00:19:55.615 --> 00:20:02.075
Yet, where did your paths stray from mine?

00:20:05.055 --> 00:20:12.135
Even now, we still believe in a paradise.

00:20:12.135 --> 00:20:13.395
Joseph...

00:20:13.395 --> 00:20:18.375
Even if it isn't something
I'll ever get to see come true,

00:20:18.375 --> 00:20:22.975
I'm sure there's someone who
will someday reach it in my place.

00:20:22.975 --> 00:20:27.475
You're the one who gave in
to the despair in front of you

00:20:27.475 --> 00:20:30.145
and forgot to pray, Xargin.

00:20:35.985 --> 00:20:41.265
Elea. Take Malek to Amanda.

00:20:41.265 --> 00:20:42.925
Joseph...

00:20:46.195 --> 00:20:47.525
Please.

00:21:04.385 --> 00:21:06.815
This is our final challenge...

00:21:08.585 --> 00:21:11.115
...and our final judgment!

00:21:16.025 --> 00:21:20.435
God shall bestow victory
upon he who is truly righteous!

00:21:23.105 --> 00:21:24.765
Go, Elea!

00:21:54.095 --> 00:22:05.215
In the dream we both had after some time passed

00:22:05.215 --> 00:22:15.625
the thing we wished for
disappeared as an illusion

00:22:15.625 --> 00:22:19.695
Just a hallucination

00:22:19.695 --> 00:22:28.795
Beyond the flames, it burned away

00:22:30.035 --> 00:22:32.335
Wish for the stars

00:22:32.335 --> 00:22:40.875
Holding countless impossible dreams

00:22:40.875 --> 00:22:43.445
A wish for the stars

00:22:43.445 --> 00:22:51.395
Far off, to where you're smiling

00:22:51.395 --> 00:22:57.025
Yes, right next to you

00:22:57.025 --> 00:23:03.005
Holding countless dreams

00:23:03.005 --> 00:23:08.765
Yes, right beside you

00:23:12.415 --> 00:23:16.745
After innumerable cold nights
and a never-ending path of thorns,

00:23:16.745 --> 00:23:19.385
the final answer is reached.

00:23:19.385 --> 00:23:22.685
Words of prayer are passed down.

00:23:22.685 --> 00:23:26.395
Final Episode: "Promised Land."

00:23:26.395 --> 00:23:31.795
If you etch the days gone by
into your heart, you won't be alone.
